# Normalise text to LF in the repository *and* in the working tree.
#
# Development is on Windows, where core.autocrlf is usually true, but prettier
# is configured endOfLine: "lf" and CI runs a Windows leg. Without eol=lf a
# clean clone on Windows checks out CRLF and fails `prettier --check` before it
# runs a single test.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Captured OTLP payloads are compared byte for byte in places; never touch them.
test/fixtures/*.json -text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
